{"id":508,"name":"stoutland","speciesId":508,"dex":508,"form":"normal","generation":5,"types":["normal"],"stats":{"hp":85,"attack":110,"defense":90,"special-attack":45,"special-defense":90,"speed":80},"abilities":[{"name":"intimidate","hidden":false},{"name":"sand-rush","hidden":false},{"name":"scrappy","hidden":true}],"height":12,"weight":610,"baseExp":225,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/508.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/508.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/508.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/508.ogg","genus":"Big-Hearted Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon de grande coração","flavor":[{"version":"black","text":"It rescues people stranded by blizzards in the mountains. Its shaggy fur shields it from the cold."},{"version":"white","text":"This extremely wise Pokémon excels at rescuing people stranded at sea or in the mountains."},{"version":"black-2","text":"Being wrapped in its long fur is so comfortable that a person would be fine even overnight on a wintry mountain."},{"version":"sun","text":"Intelligent, good-natured, and valiant, it’s a trustworthy partner on rescue teams."},{"version":"moon","text":"With this wise Pokémon, there could be no concern that it would ever attack people. Some parents even trust it to babysit."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It pays no mind to the cold, thanks to its long warm coat. Stoutland in Alola look a little uncomfortable."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its fur is long and thick. A long time ago in cold regions, every household kept a Stoutland."},{"version":"sword","text":"These Pokémon seem to enjoy living with humans. Even a Stoutland caught in the wild will warm up to people in about three days."},{"version":"shield","text":"Stoutland is immensely proud of its impressive moustache. It’s said that moustache length is what determines social standing among this species."}],"flavorPt":"Stoutland tem imenso orgulho de seu bigode impressionante. Diz-se que o comprimento do bigode é o que determina a posição social desta espécie.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":45,"eggGroups":["ground"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"lillipup","speciesId":506,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 16"],"species":"herdier","speciesId":507,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 32"],"species":"stoutland","speciesId":508,"evolvesTo":[]}]}]},"varieties":[{"id":508,"name":"stoutland","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/508.png"}],"games":[11,14,15,16,17,18,20],"moves":[{"id":33,"learn":[[11,"lv",1],[14,"lv",1],[15,"lv",1],[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1],[20,"lv",1]]},{"id":36,"learn":[[11,"lv",15],[14,"lv",15],[15,"lv",15],[16,"lv",15],[17,"lv",15],[18,"lv",15],[20,"lv",38]]},{"id":43,"learn":[[11,"lv",1],[14,"lv",1],[15,"lv",1],[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1],[20,"lv",1]]},{"id":44,"learn":[[11,"lv",1],[11,"lv",8],[14,"lv",1],[14,"lv",8],[15,"lv",1],[15,"lv",8],[16,"lv",1],[16,"lv",8],[17,"lv",1],[17,"lv",8],[18,"lv",1],[18,"lv",8],[20,"lv",1]]},{"id":46,"learn":[[11,"lv",29],[11,"tm",0],[14,"lv",29],[14,"tm",0],[15,"lv",29],[15,"tm",0],[16,"lv",29],[16,"tm",0],[17,"lv",29],[17,"tm",0],[18,"lv",29],[18,"tm",0],[20,"lv",62]]},{"id":57,"learn":[[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":63,"learn":[[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":70,"learn":[[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0]]},{"id":85,"learn":[[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":86,"learn":[[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":87,"learn":[[11,"tm",0